  m_text: "\xBBOver a seven-day stint, we follow a character named LORD God as he
    creates the heavens, the earth, and everything in between [\u2026]. He then goes
    on to form [\u2026] a male human. \nAfter breathing life into this man\u2019s
    nostrils, he hovers eastward to Eden, not too far from Ethiopia. There, LORD
    God plants [\u2026] a [\u2026] colourful garden with birds and bees, flowers
    and trees. [\u2026]"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
